```css
@layer astryx.overrides {
  :root {
    --astryx-scrollbar-size: 12px;
    --astryx-scrollbar-thumb: color-mix(in srgb, var(--astryx-color-text-primary) 35%, transparent);
    --astryx-scrollbar-radius: 4px;
  }
}
```

变量可以写在任何祖先元素上，所以只想改某一块，就写在那一块的选择器里。也可以放进 [`Theme`](/components/theme) 的主题变量里，跟着主题一起切。更多变量的约定见 [CSS 变量](/themes/css-variables)。

usage.en:
Smooths bursty streamed text into a steady character-by-character reveal using requestAnimationFrame. Decouples arrival rate from display rate. Advances on grapheme boundaries, so a slice never cuts a surrogate pair, a flag, or a joined emoji in half. Animation timing comes from the `--astryx-duration-fast-min` motion token, with a fallback outside a theme provider. Snaps to full text when `isStreaming` becomes false, and stays on the full text while the reader prefers reduced motion.

Pass the accumulated text, not individual chunks; the hook handles the incremental reveal itself. `displayedText` is a `ComputedRef<string>`, so render it straight away.

```ts
import { useStreamingText } from '@astryx-vue/core'
import { ref } from 'vue'

const targetText = ref('')
const isStreaming = ref(true)
const displayedText = useStreamingText(targetText, isStreaming, { speed: 'natural' })
```

usage.zh:
把一坨一坨到达的文字抹平成稳定的逐字显示，用 requestAnimationFrame 推进。到达的速度和显示的速度互不影响。每次推进会退回到字素边界，所以不会把代理对、旗帜或拼在一起的 emoji 切成两半。节奏取自 `--astryx-duration-fast-min` 这个动效 token，不在主题里时用兜底值。`isStreaming` 变成 false 时直接跳到全文；用户偏好减少动态效果时也一直是全文。

传累积后的整段文字，不要传一块一块的分片，增量显示它自己会处理。`displayedText` 是 `ComputedRef<string>`，直接拿去渲染就行。

```ts
import { useStreamingText } from '@astryx-vue/core'
import { ref } from 'vue'

const targetText = ref('')
const isStreaming = ref(true)
const displayedText = useStreamingText(targetText, isStreaming, { speed: 'natural' })
```

usage.en:
Hook that returns a `TablePlugin` adding draggable resize handles to column header borders. Every resizable column gets a handle on its inline end, except the last proportional column: that one keeps flexing to fill whatever space is left. Dragging previews the new widths, and releasing the pointer commits them: `onColumnResizeEnd` receives a map of every column key whose width changed, and you merge it into `columnWidths`.

```ts
import { useTableColumnResize } from '@astryx-vue/core/Table'
```

A proportional column hands width to the next resizable column, so the table stays full width while you drag. A pixel column has no neighbour to lean on, so only its own width changes and the last column takes up the difference.

```ts
const columnWidths = ref<Record<string, number>>({})
const resizePlugin = useTableColumnResize(() => ({
  columnWidths: columnWidths.value,
  minWidth: 80,
  maxWidth: 400,
  onColumnResizeEnd(updates) {
    columnWidths.value = { ...columnWidths.value, ...updates }
  },
}))
```

The config is read again on every access, so pass a getter when the widths live in a `ref`. A plain object works too, but it keeps whatever widths it had the first time the table asked.

usage.zh:
这个组合式函数返回一个 `TablePlugin`，给列表头的边缘加上可以拖的把手。除了最后一列比例列之外，每列行末都有一个把手；最后一列比例列不给把手，它负责吃掉剩下的空间。拖动时先按新宽度预览，松开指针才提交：`onColumnResizeEnd` 拿到所有宽度变了的列，你把它并进 `columnWidths`。

```ts
import { useTableColumnResize } from '@astryx-vue/core/Table'
```

比例列把宽度让给旁边可拖的列，所以拖动时表格一直撑满。固定像素列没有邻列可让，只有自己变宽变窄，差值由最后一列吸收。

```ts
const columnWidths = ref<Record<string, number>>({})
const resizePlugin = useTableColumnResize(() => ({
  columnWidths: columnWidths.value,
  minWidth: 80,
  maxWidth: 400,
  onColumnResizeEnd(updates) {
    columnWidths.value = { ...columnWidths.value, ...updates }
  },
}))
```

每次读配置都会重新取值，所以宽度存在 `ref` 里时要传 getter。直接传对象也能跑，但表格会用第一次读到的那份宽度。

en.text:
The companion hook. It holds the keys, and every write goes through it so `isAlwaysVisible` columns cannot be removed.

```ts
const state = useTableColumnSettingsState({
  columns: columnOptions,
  activeColumnKeys: activeKeys,
  onChangeActiveColumnKeys(keys) {
    activeKeys.value = [...keys]
  },
})
const plugin = useTableColumnSettings(state.columnSettingsConfig)
```

It takes the same fields as the config plus `defaultColumnKeys`.

zh.text:
配套的组合式函数。它替你拿住这些 key，所有写入都走它，所以 `isAlwaysVisible` 的列不会被删掉。

```ts
const state = useTableColumnSettingsState({
  columns: columnOptions,
  activeColumnKeys: activeKeys,
  onChangeActiveColumnKeys(keys) {
    activeKeys.value = [...keys]
  },
})
const plugin = useTableColumnSettings(state.columnSettingsConfig)
```

参数和上面那份配置一样，另外多一个 `defaultColumnKeys`。

